      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:13.640403Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Added a builtin called ``sorted()`` which may be used in expressions.",
      "source_hash": 6332722920113634605,
      "context_hash": 479014567687766060,
      "translation": "표현식에서 사용할 수 있는 ``sorted()``\\ 라는 내장 함수를 추가했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:13.640403Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "The ``itertools`` module has two new functions, ``tee()`` and ``groupby()``.",
      "source_hash": 17785488783766948300,
      "context_hash": 7993143175437289960,
      "translation": "``itertools`` 모듈에 ``tee()``\\ 와 ``groupby()``\\ 라는 두 개의 새 함수가 추가되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:13.640403Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Add a ``collections`` module with a ``deque()`` object.",
      "source_hash": 14646521814337854732,
      "context_hash": 15086350847830845621,
      "translation": "``deque()`` 객체를 포함한 ``collections`` 모듈을 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:13.640403Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Add two statistical/reduction functions, ``nlargest()`` and ``nsmallest()`` to the ``heapq`` module.",
      "source_hash": 970414202811984582,
      "context_hash": 15216870258249691670,
      "translation": "``heapq`` 모듈에 두 개의 통계/축약 함수 ``nlargest()``\\ 와 ``nsmallest()``\\ 를 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:13.640404Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Python's windows installer now uses MSI",
      "source_hash": 7722430611596592137,
      "context_hash": 126100287376085609,
      "translation": "Python의 Windows 설치 프로그램은 이제 MSI를 사용합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:17.341930Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
