      "context_hash": 1382376606792020123,
      "translation": ":pep:`11`\\ 에 설명된 대로 플랫폼 지원을 제거합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:17.341930Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Finish implementing the Distutils ``bdist_dpkg`` command.  (AMK)",
      "source_hash": 13929926032965731888,
      "context_hash": 16799629666368518276,
      "translation": "Distutils ``bdist_dpkg`` 명령의 구현을 완료합니다.  (AMK)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:17.341930Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Add support for reading shadow passwords [1]_",
      "source_hash": 865551228098515204,
      "context_hash": 13897517161670881307,
      "translation": "섀도 비밀번호 읽기 지원을 추가합니다 [1]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:17.341930Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "It would be nice if the built-in SSL socket type could be used for non-blocking SSL I/O.",
      "source_hash": 8066622701143892693,
      "context_hash": 4258232593227204549,
      "translation": "내장 SSL 소켓 타입을 논블로킹 SSL I/O에 사용할 수 있다면 좋을 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:17.341930Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Currently packages such as Twisted which implement async servers using SSL have to require third-party packages such as pyopenssl.",
      "source_hash": 8491949178179599148,
      "context_hash": 16801651823026708337,
      "translation": "현재 SSL을 사용하는 비동기 서버를 구현하는 Twisted 같은 패키지는 pyopenssl 같은 서드파티 패키지를 요구해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:17.341931Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "AST-based compiler: this branch was not completed in time for 2.4, but will land on the trunk some time after 2.4 final is out, for inclusion in 2.5.",
      "source_hash": 9487535980687393579,
      "context_hash": 10244833946263402661,
      "translation": "AST 기반 컴파일러: 이 브랜치는 2.4에 맞춰 완료되지 못했지만, 2.4 최종판이 나온 뒤 언젠가 트렁크에 반영되어 2.5에 포함될 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:17.341931Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "reST is going to be used a lot in Zope3.",
      "source_hash": 13123431468221734504,
      "context_hash": 16597211509837862580,
      "translation": "reST는 Zope3에서 많이 사용될 예정입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:17.341931Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Maybe it could become a standard library module?  (Since reST's author thinks it's too instable, I'm inclined not to do this.)",
      "source_hash": 10760451444234900982,
      "context_hash": 17450235188450769317,
      "translation": "어쩌면 표준 라이브러리 모듈이 될 수도 있지 않겠습니까?  (reST의 작성자가 아직 너무 불안정하다고 생각하므로, 저는 이것을 하지 않는 쪽으로 기울어 있습니다.)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "standard library": "표준 라이브러리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T13:10:17.341931Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
