    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The following are ongoing TO-DO items which we should attempt to work on without hoping for completion by any particular date.",
      "source_hash": 17130628534136018577,
      "context_hash": 16326489388503170384,
      "translation": "다음은 특정 날짜까지 완료되기를 기대하지 않고 작업을 시도해야 할 진행 중인 TO-DO 항목입니다.",
